# dexMonitor — WebSocket
# REST Client does not support WebSocket connections.
# Use one of the options below instead.

# --- Option 1: websocat (CLI) ---
# Install: cargo install websocat  OR  sudo apt install websocat
#
#   websocat ws://127.0.0.1:5000/ws/live_offers
#
# The server sends the full offer array immediately on connect,
# then pushes updates on every Kraken price tick.

# --- Option 2: Hoppscotch (browser, open source) ---
# Open https://hoppscotch.io → Realtime → WebSocket
# URL: ws://127.0.0.1:5000/ws/live_offers

# --- Option 3: wscat (Node.js CLI) ---
# Install: npm install -g wscat
#
#   wscat -c ws://127.0.0.1:5000/ws/live_offers
